  "slug": "roofing-punch-list-checklist-form",
  "title": "Roofing Punch List and Acceptance Checklist",
  "subtitle": "Define the roofing acceptance basis, log location-specific deficiencies, assign corrections, retain reinspection evidence, resolve exceptions, and record final handoff.",
  "description": "A controlled Roofing punch list covering inspection identity and document basis, system-specific acceptance criteria, a detailed deficiency register, responsible owners and due dates, containment and access, correction evidence, failed reinspection, deferred items, customer decisions, final acceptance, and closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when the roofing foreperson, quality reviewer, project manager, affected trades, and customer need one location-based Roofing completion register that stays open until every item has a supported disposition.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
